[{"id":4552,"date":"2026-04-07T02:06:58","date_gmt":"2026-04-07T02:06:58","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/riseoak.com\/?p=4552"},"modified":"2026-07-21T21:06:14","modified_gmt":"2026-07-21T21:06:14","slug":"msp-content-marketing","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/riseoak.com\/msp-content-marketing\/","title":{"rendered":"The MSP Content Marketing Workflow That Ranks on Google, Gets Cited by AI, and Converts Readers"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"4552\" class=\"elementor elementor-4552\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-2f8d3e24 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"2f8d3e24\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-57d5d635\" data-id=\"57d5d635\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3753bde2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3753bde2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Most MSPs know they need content marketing \u2014 but creating content that actually ranks on Google and gets cited by AI tools like ChatGPT is a different challenge entirely.<\/p>\n<p>The good news: there&#8217;s a repeatable three-tool process that solves this without sacrificing quality or accuracy.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-a5e42a3 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"a5e42a3\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-b2652cc\" data-id=\"b2652cc\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8728bc8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-video\" data-id=\"8728bc8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;youtube_url&quot;:&quot;https:\\\/\\\/youtu.be\\\/rmUNqbTJusI&quot;,&quot;video_type&quot;:&quot;youtube&quot;,&quot;controls&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"video.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-wrapper elementor-open-inline\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-video\"><\/div>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-395b226 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"395b226\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-3fb2040\" data-id=\"3fb2040\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f54701c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"f54701c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">The Problem With How Most MSPs Use AI for Content<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ceb76d9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ceb76d9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>AI-generated content has a reputation problem \u2014 and for good reason. When you hand a prompt to ChatGPT and publish whatever comes out, readers notice. Search engines notice. And increasingly, so do AI assistants when deciding which sources to cite.<\/p>\n<p>The issue isn&#8217;t using AI. The issue is using it without structure, original data, or a fact-checking step. Done wrong, AI content hurts your credibility. Done right, it becomes one of the most efficient and effective tools in your MSP content marketing strategy.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-67772d4 elementor-section-height-min-height elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-items-middle\" data-id=\"67772d4\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-ef50c32\" data-id=\"ef50c32\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e6601f6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"e6601f6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Get Ahead While Most MSPs Are Still Watching<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-4816960 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"4816960\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-9f60cd9\" data-id=\"9f60cd9\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3be2ebb elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"3be2ebb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-md\" href=\"https:\/\/riseoak.com\/msp-ai-visibility-roadmap\/\" id=\"get-free-blueprint-hero\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Free AI Visibility Pilot<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-17355bd elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"17355bd\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-48eed10\" data-id=\"48eed10\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1959f6b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"1959f6b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">The 3-Tool Process That Actually Works<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1c89d06 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1c89d06\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>This process is built specifically for structured, fact-based pages \u2014 think service pages targeting a specific city, like &#8220;Managed IT Services in Charlotte.&#8221; It&#8217;s not designed for opinion pieces or thought leadership content, which still require significant human input.<\/p>\n<p>Here&#8217;s how the workflow breaks down.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-e145ca5 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"e145ca5\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-c1b51fa\" data-id=\"c1b51fa\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f6a1da1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"f6a1da1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Step 1: Use ChatGPT to Build the Structure<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7be7d4b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7be7d4b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Before writing a single sentence, start with structure. Ask ChatGPT to generate multiple options for your headline, subheadings, and key pain points.<\/p>\n<p>For example, you might ask it to produce five variations of your main H1, five sub-headline options, and eight customer pain points relevant to your service offering. From there, your writer reviews the options, selects the strongest ones, and may tweak them slightly before assembling a page outline.<\/p>\n<p>This step keeps the creative structure in human hands while letting AI accelerate the ideation process. The result is a page blueprint your writer actually owns \u2014 not just something they copied and pasted.<\/p>\n<p><!-- notionvc: e8ac9af2-e752-46b4-9cb8-55d61b64c560 --><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-45305ca elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"45305ca\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Step 2: Use Claude to Write Content Inside the Structure<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-62f925f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"62f925f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Once the outline is locked in, Claude takes over for the actual writing. The key to making this work is feeding Claude your own unique data and facts through a dedicated project.<\/p>\n<p>Inside Claude, you can set up a project that contains proprietary information \u2014 client results, industry statistics, or service-specific details unique to your MSP. When Claude writes within this context, the output is grounded in your actual data rather than generic claims. This is what makes the content original.<\/p>\n<p>Claude also allows you to highlight specific sections within an artifact and request targeted edits \u2014 a detail, a rewrite, a tone adjustment \u2014 without redoing the entire piece. This makes iteration fast and precise.<\/p>\n<p><!-- notionvc: e8ac9af2-e752-46b4-9cb8-55d61b64c560 --><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b772531 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"b772531\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Step 3: Fact-Check Everything With NotebookLM<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9f2f520 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9f2f520\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Any claim that references a fact, statistic, or data point gets sent to NotebookLM before the article is published. This is the quality control layer that most AI content workflows skip \u2014 and skipping it is exactly why so much AI content erodes trust.<\/p>\n<p>In NotebookLM, you maintain a project loaded with your verified source documents. Paste in the relevant section from Claude&#8217;s output and ask NotebookLM to assess whether the claims are accurate. It returns a detailed analysis based on your source material.<\/p>\n<p>If something is flagged as inaccurate or misleading, take that feedback back to Claude, highlight the problematic section, and ask for a revision based on the NotebookLM findings. The loop closes quickly, and the final content is both readable and defensible.<\/p>\n<p><!-- notionvc: e8ac9af2-e752-46b4-9cb8-55d61b64c560 --><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fd3574d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"fd3574d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Why This Matters for MSP Content Marketing<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-08843c9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"08843c9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>This isn&#8217;t just about efficiency \u2014 it&#8217;s about trust signals. Content that is factually accurate, clearly structured, and anchored in real data is the type of content that earns rankings in traditional search and gets cited by AI tools like ChatGPT, Perplexity, and Google&#8217;s AI Overviews.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ecfe0f3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"ecfe0f3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Conclusion<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-437af81 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"437af81\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>AI tools won&#8217;t replace the judgment of a good marketer \u2014 but they will outpace any MSP that refuses to use them strategically. The ChatGPT \u2192 Claude \u2192 NotebookLM workflow gives your team a reliable, repeatable process for producing content that performs with humans, search engines, and AI platforms alike.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Most MSPs know they need content marketing \u2014 but creating content that actually ranks on Google and gets cited by AI tools like ChatGPT is a different challenge entirely. The good news: there&#8217;s a repeatable three-tool process that solves this without sacrificing quality or accuracy. https:\/\/youtu.be\/rmUNqbTJusI The Problem With How Most MSPs Use AI for [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":4564,"comment_status":"open